Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:36:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command routing so backend
 commands target the active chat

Selected agent messages that begin with a slash command now use the provider command path instead of normal chat send. The Codex backend resumes the recorded thread with the command text, which keeps commands such as /status scoped to the active session while preserving streaming output through the controller.
